+promotion_basis: ""
+---
+# Alpine Release Containers Need POSIX Sh
+
+## Observation
+
+When adding `linux-musl-x64` release builds with a `python:3.11-alpine` container, the existing Docker helper could not assume `bash` was available. Alpine images provide `/bin/sh` by default, while Debian-based images also work with `sh -lc`.
+
+## Reusable Lesson
+
+Release helper code that needs to support both Debian and Alpine containers should use POSIX `sh -lc` unless it explicitly installs Bash before invoking the command shell.
+
+## Scope
+
+Applies to Linux release-build and runtime-verification helpers that run commands inside Docker images from different base distributions.
+
+## Source Pointer
+
+Captured while expanding the public release and npm distribution matrix to include `linux-musl-x64`.
